gt;These rates are approved by FERC, and any changes in rate require FERC acceptance and approval.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Depreciation and amortization for the year ended December&#160;31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; were approximately $3,002&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;NOTE 5.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;OPERATING REVENUES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company's revenues are received in accordance with the Southwest Power Pool Inc (SPP) Tariff which includes the Company's formula rate as approved by the FERC. The Company is required to file its annual true-up of the prior calendar year by May 15th and the projected net revenue requirement for the current calendar year by September 15th.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfRateTreatmentWhereUnamortizedLossOnReacquiredDebtAndUnamortizedGainOnReacquiredDebtAccountsAreNotUsedTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfRetainedEarningsRestrictionsTextBlock id="f-35" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;NOTE 6.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;LONG-TERM BORROWING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company has a long term loan with NEECH which allows the Company to continue to borrow to keep its capital structure of 60% equity and 40% debt balanced as its capital requirements arise.&#160;The long-term loan was renewed most recently in December 2025 and is due in November 2030. Draws for the years ended December 31, 2025 of $65,378 are reflected as non-cash equity distributions on the Statement of Cash Flows. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Long-term debt consists of the following as of December 31: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:77.916%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:75.905%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.513%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:20.290%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.692%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding: