              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Services provided by affiliated companies may include executive &amp; governance, finance &amp; accounting, corporate communications, legal, corporate real estate, human resources, payroll, security, internal audit, information management operations and maintenance, and license fees. Services are allocated to affiliates using specific drivers such as headcount or number of workstations. If cost cannot be attributed, the services are allocated using the Massachusetts Formula.</span>
